From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] findstr: character classes, word boundaries and the missing switches (3524)

findstr: character classes, word boundaries and the missing switches

The regular expression matcher gets [set], [^set], ranges, \< and \> next to ., *, ^, $ and escapes.
New switches: /B /E /X /V /N /M /O /L /S /P /F: /G: /D: and the ones that are accepted and ignored
(/A: /OFF). Several files prefix the file name; a file that cannot be opened is exit code 2.
